sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title WF1 - Prepare and publish an oral exam (Milestone 3 target)
    actor Lecturer
    actor Student
    participant UI as React UI
    participant API as ASP.NET API
    participant Service as Application / Infrastructure
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Lecturer,DB: Target WF1 contract. Auth cookie and X-CSRF-TOKEN are required for writes.
    Lecturer->>UI: Sign in and open Question Bank workspace
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login (after GET /auth/csrf)
    API-->>UI: Auth cookie and Lecturer role

    Lecturer->>UI: Create Question Bank
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/question-banks
    API->>Service: Validate and create bank
    Service->>DB: INSERT question_banks
    DB-->>Service: Bank ID
    Service-->>API: Bank DTO
    API-->>UI: 201 Created

    loop For each main question
        Lecturer->>UI: Add question to bank
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/question-banks/{bankId}/questions
        API->>Service: Validate and create question
        Service->>DB: INSERT questions
        DB-->>Service: Question ID
        Service-->>UI: Question DTO
        loop For each expected key point
            Lecturer->>UI: Enter expected key point
            UI->>API: POST .../questions/{questionId}/expected-key-points
            API->>Service: Validate question and content
            Service->>DB: INSERT expected_key_points
            Service-->>UI: 201 Key point DTO
        end
    end

    Lecturer->>UI: Define rubric and weighted criteria
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/question-banks/{bankId}/rubric
    API->>Service: Validate and create rubric
    Service->>DB: INSERT rubrics
    Service-->>UI: 201 Rubric DTO
    loop For each criterion
        UI->>API: POST .../rubric/criteria
        API->>Service: Validate maxScore and weight
        Service->>DB: INSERT rubric_criteria
        Service-->>UI: 201 Criterion DTO
    end

    Lecturer->>UI: Create Draft session for this bank
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/exam-sessions (status Draft)
    API->>Service: Validate and create session
    Service->>DB: INSERT exam_sessions
    Service-->>UI: 201 Session DTO
    Lecturer->>UI: Select questions and their order
    UI->>API: PUT /api/v1/exam-sessions/{id}/questions
    API->>Service: Check Draft, bank membership and unique IDs
    Service->>DB: Replace exam_session_questions with content snapshots
    Service-->>UI: 200 Selected questions

    Lecturer->>UI: Publish session
    UI->>API: PUT /api/v1/exam-sessions/{id} (status Open)
    API->>Service: Begin transaction and check readiness
    Service->>DB: Check selection, key points, rubric and weight = 1
    alt Missing preparation data
        DB-->>Service: Missing items
        Service-->>API: session_not_ready + missing codes
        API-->>UI: 409 Conflict with missing fields
    else Ready
        Service->>DB: UPDATE exam_sessions to Open and commit
        Service-->>API: Open session DTO
        API-->>UI: 200 Open session
    end

    Note over Student,DB: Handoff to WF2. Basic Student join is part of the M3 demo.
    Student->>UI: View Open sessions and choose Vao thi
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/exam-sessions then POST /{id}/join
    API->>Service: Check Student role and Open status
    Service->>DB: Get or create exam_attempt and read selected snapshots
    DB-->>Service: Attempt and ordered selected questions
    Service-->>UI: 200 Attempt DTO (same attempt on repeat join)
    UI-->>Student: Show selected questions only
